The third-party software covered here is the native code compiled into the MCL
libraries shipped under runtimes/:

    runtimes/linux-arm64/native/libmcl.so
    runtimes/linux-x64/native/libmcl.so
    runtimes/osx-arm64/native/libmcl.dylib
    runtimes/osx-x64/native/libmcl.dylib
